# Release-profile nvcc flags for sm_89 (RTX 40 / Ada).
# One flag per line. Text from '#' to end of line is a comment; blank lines are
# ignored. Read by build_solver.{sh,bat} (release profile) and
# build_pool_miner.{sh,bat}. TARI_ARCH_FLAGS, when non-empty, replaces this list.
#
# Intentionally empty: this arch builds with the kernel defaults (including 50
# trim rounds) until a tuning sweep on real sm_89 hardware picks a flag set.
